<title>MOLDOVA: Moldovan leu edges up to 4.674 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Moldovan leu edges up to 4.674 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moldovan leu edged up to 4.674 to the dollar on the Moldovan Interbank Currency Exchange from 4.675 at the previous trading session.</p>
<p>				    Dec 12		  Dec 11</p>
<p> lei per dollar		 4.674		   4.675</p>
<p> volume traded ($)	    300,000		 100,000</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
